'''Ancient Egg: N107''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked from the [[Catnip Challenges]] after completing 35 [[Behemoth Culling]] stages for the first time. It was added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]]. [[True Form]] massively improves overall stats and increases cost and recharge time, while gaining Area Attacks, a chance for a [[Mini-Wave]], Soulstrike, and Behemoth Slayer.

