==Trivia==
*The neck rings that Cat Chief wears somewhat resemble those worn by the [[wikipedia:Kayan people (Myanmar)|Kayan people]] of Myanmar.
*The line, "Famous for teapot choreography," in Cat Chief's description is a reference to Japanese choreographer [[wikipedia:ja:ラッキィ池田|Lucky Ikeda]], who is known for dancing with a [http://luckyikeda.com/profile/luckyikeda/ red elephant teapot] on his head. Cat Chief's Japanese description says it danced with a kettle on its head, making the reference more obvious.
*[[Masked Yulala (Special Cat)|Masked Yulala]], Cat Chief and [[Hanasaka Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Hanasaka Cat]] all have similar movement animations.

